---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | ApprovedDecorators">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-blue">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
    <p>At ApprovedDecorators, we take your privacy seriously and are fully committed to complying with GDPR and protecting your personal data.</p>
    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you request a quote or contact us, we collect your name, phone number, email address, and property details necessary to provide you with an accurate estimate.</p>
    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use your information solely to facilitate painting and decorating services, communicate regarding your project, and ensure the highest quality of service.</p>
    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. We only share necessary details with our vetted local decorators assigned to your project.</p>
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>For any privacy-related questions, please contact our data protection officer via our contact channels.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
